          "type": "turn_end",
          "turn": {
            "text": "Alberto has built three AI agents:\n\n1. **Fraud Detection Agent** (in progress), built for Satella Tickets, the event ticketing platform he co-founded and runs as a side business. It monitors ticket purchases and flags or blocks suspicious orders, such as card testing or bulk resale patterns, and escalates to a human below a confidence threshold. Stack: TypeScript, PostgreSQL, GCP.\n2. **Organizer Support Agent**, also for Satella Tickets. It answers event organizers' questions about sales, payouts and setup, pulling live data from PostgreSQL and the payments API. Stack: TypeScript, tool calling, MCP, PostgreSQL.\n3. **Portfolio Agent** (personal project), the assistant on this site. It answers visitors' questions about his experience and projects, and is also exposed as an MCP server so external agents can query it. Stack: TypeScript, Claude, MCP.",
